        "original_id": "01fe6b51-e99a-520a-a5a0-4c0476b48a3a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yasuzo Masumura, Peter Glenville, Ayako Wakao, Kiyoshi Atsumi, Torajirō Kuruma\n- Organizations: Daiei Studios\n- Works: Tora-san's Shattered Romance\n- Roles: film director, actor, stage actor, Madonna\n\nFacts:\n- Yasuzo Masumura was a Japanese film director who was born on August 25, 1924, and died on November 23, 1986.\n- Peter Glenville, born Peter Patrick Brabazon Browne, was an English film and stage actor and director who was born on October 28, 1913, and died on June 3, 1996.\n- Ayako Wakao was contracted to Daiei Studios in 1951 as part of the fifth \"New Face\" group.\n- Ayako Wakao often appeared in films directed by Yasuzo Masumura.\n- Tora-san's Shattered Romance stars Kiyoshi Atsumi as Torajirō Kuruma, also known as Tora-san.\n- Tora-san's Shattered Romance also stars Ayako Wakao as the love interest, or \"Madonna.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
